msgid "### Consistency"
msgstr "### 一致性"

msgid "#### Expert Map"
msgstr "#### 专家映射"

msgid ""
"The expert map must be globally unique during initialization and update. In a multi-node scenario during initialization, distributed communication should be used to verify the consistency of expert maps across each rank. If they are inconsistent, the user should be notified of which ranks have inconsistent maps.\n"
"During the update process, if only a few layers or the expert table of a certain rank has been changed, the updated expert table must be synchronized with the EPLB's context to ensure global consistency."
msgstr ""
"专家映射在初始化和更新过程中必须全局唯一。在初始化时的多节点场景下，应使用分布式通信验证每个 rank 上专家映射的一致性。如果不一致，应通知用户哪些 rank 的映射不一致。\n"
"在更新过程中，如果仅更改了少数层或某个 rank 的专家表，则必须将更新后的专家表与 EPLB 的上下文同步，以确保全局一致性。"

msgid "#### Expert Weight"
msgstr "#### 专家权重"

msgid ""
"When updating expert weights, ensure that the memory allocated for the "
"expert weights has been released, or that the expert (referring to the old "
"version) is no longer in use."
msgstr "更新专家权重时，请确保已释放为专家权重分配的内存，或者该专家（指旧版本）不再使用。"

msgid "## Limitations"
msgstr "## 限制"

msgid ""
"**1. Adaptor Module**\n"
"*Handles registration and adaptation for different MoE model types*"
msgstr ""
"**1. 适配器模块**\n"
"*负责不同 MoE 模型类型的注册与适配*"

msgid ""
"- `vllm_adaptor.py`\n"
"  Registers MoE layers through the `VllmEplbAdaptor.register_layer` hook during layer initialization (missing pipeline layers are skipped naturally), exposes per-layer expert parameters to the policy algorithms, and applies placement updates back to the model. Model-level facts such as `first_k_dense_replace` are read from the model config; the expert count and EP rank are taken from the first registered MoE layer in `VllmEplbAdaptor.__init__`."
msgstr ""
"- `vllm_adaptor.py`\n"
"  在层初始化期间通过 `VllmEplbAdaptor.register_layer` 钩子注册 MoE 层（缺失的流水线层会被自然跳过），向策略算法暴露各层的专家参数，并将放置更新应用回模型。诸如 `first_k_dense_replace` 等模型级信息从模型配置中读取；专家数量和 EP rank 在 `VllmEplbAdaptor.__init__` 中从第一个注册的 MoE 层获取。"

msgid ""
"**2. Core Module**\n"
"*Implements core algorithms, updates, and asynchronous processing*"
msgstr ""
"**2. 核心模块**\n"
"*实现核心算法、更新和异步处理*"

msgid ""
"- **Policy Submodule**\n"
"  *Load balancing algorithms with factory pattern instantiation*\n"
"    - `policy_abstract.py`\n"
"      Abstract class for load balancing strategy interfaces\n"
"    - `policy_default_eplb.py`\n"
"      Default implementation of open-source EPLB paper algorithm\n"
"    - `policy_factory.py`\n"
"      Strategy factory for automatic algorithm instantiation\n"
"    - `policy_flashlb.py`\n"
"      Threshold-based adjustment reducing operational costs through layer-wise fluctuation detection\n"
"    - `policy_random.py`\n"
"      Random policy for basic testing\n"
"    - `policy_swift_balancer.py`\n"
"      Enhanced version optimizing expert swaps for low-bandwidth devices (e.g., A2)"
msgstr ""
"- **策略子模块**\n"
"  *采用工厂模式实例化的负载均衡算法*\n"
"    - `policy_abstract.py`\n"
"      负载均衡策略接口的抽象类\n"
"    - `policy_default_eplb.py`\n"
"      开源 EPLB 论文算法的默认实现\n"
"    - `policy_factory.py`\n"
"      用于自动实例化算法的策略工厂\n"
"    - `policy_flashlb.py`\n"
"      基于阈值的调整，通过逐层波动检测降低运维成本\n"
"    - `policy_random.py`\n"
"      用于基础测试的随机策略\n"
"    - `policy_swift_balancer.py`\n"
"      针对低带宽设备（如 A2）优化专家交换的增强版本"

msgid ""
"- `eplb_device_transfer_loader.py`\n"
"  Manages expert table/weight transmission and updates\n"
"- `eplb_utils.py`\n"
"  Utilities for expert table initialization and mapping\n"
"- `eplb_worker.py`\n"
"  Asynchronous algorithm orchestration and result processing"
msgstr ""
"- `eplb_device_transfer_loader.py`\n"
"  管理专家表/权重的传输与更新\n"
"- `eplb_utils.py`\n"
"  用于专家表初始化和映射的工具\n"
"- `eplb_worker.py`\n"
"  异步算法编排与结果处理"

msgid ""
"- `eplb_updator.py`\n"
"  Central coordinator for load balancing during inference workflows"
msgstr ""
"- `eplb_updator.py`\n"
"  推理工作流中负载均衡的中央协调器"

msgid "### Runtime Lifecycle"
msgstr "### 运行时生命周期"

msgid ""
"One full update cycle spans `expert_heat_collection_interval +\n"
"algorithm_execution_interval + num_moe_layers` forward iterations:"
msgstr ""
"一个完整的更新周期跨越 `expert_heat_collection_interval +\n"
"algorithm_execution_interval + num_moe_layers` 次前向迭代："

msgid ""
"1. **Heat collection** (forward thread): every MoE layer accumulates\n"
"   physical-expert token counts into a per-layer load tensor. Iterations are\n"
"   classified as prefill or decode by comparing the padded scheduled token\n"
"   count with the maximum expected decode-iteration token count; iterations\n"
"   outside `eplb_heat_collection_stage` contribute nothing and do not advance\n"
"   the collection counter.\n"
"2. **Gather and wakeup**: at the end of the collection phase, per-layer loads\n"
"   are all-gathered over the `dynamic_eplb` process group and written into a\n"
"   manager-shared dict, then the algorithm subprocess is woken through a\n"
"   queue.\n"
"3. **Algorithm execution** (per-rank spawned EPLB subprocess): the configured\n"
"   policy computes a new placement, the result is validated (every logical\n"
"   expert placed exactly once per layer, replicas on distinct ranks), and a\n"
"   greedy per-layer send/receive plan is produced.\n"
"4. **Layer-by-layer weight update** (forward thread): one MoE layer per\n"
"   iteration. The D2D transfers for the layer are issued asynchronously\n"
"   before the forward pass and committed after it; expert maps and the\n"
"   logical-to-physical table are updated on the same iteration."
msgstr ""
"1. **热度收集**（前向线程）：每个 MoE 层将物理专家的 token 计数累加到\n"
"   每层负载张量中。通过将补齐后的调度 token 数与解码迭代的最大预期\n"
"   token 数进行比较，将迭代分类为 prefill 或 decode；`eplb_heat_collection_stage`\n"
"   之外的迭代不产生任何贡献，也不会推进收集计数器。\n"
"2. **汇总与唤醒**：在收集阶段结束时，各层负载通过 `dynamic_eplb` 进程组\n"
"   进行 all-gather 并写入管理器共享字典，然后通过队列唤醒算法子进程。\n"
"3. **算法执行**（每个 rank 派生的 EPLB 子进程）：配置的策略计算新的放置方案，\n"
"   对结果进行校验（每个逻辑专家在每层恰好放置一次，副本位于不同 rank），\n"
"   并生成贪心的逐层发送/接收计划。\n"
"4. **逐层权重更新**（前向线程）：每次迭代处理一个 MoE 层。该层的 D2D 传输\n"
"   在前向传递之前异步发起，并在其后提交；专家映射和逻辑到物理表在同一次\n"
"   迭代中更新。"

msgid ""
"1. Inherit the `EplbPolicy` abstract class of `policy_abstract.py` and override the `rebalance_experts` interface, keeping the input parameters `current_expert_table` (shape `[num_layers, num_ranks, num_experts_per_rank]`) and `expert_workload`, and returning the `(changed_flag, per_layer_priority, new_expert_table)` tuple that the shipped policies return, where `per_layer_priority` orders the layers by how much the computed placement changes them.\n"
"For example:"
msgstr ""
"1. 继承 `policy_abstract.py` 中的 `EplbPolicy` 抽象类并重写 `rebalance_experts` 接口，保持输入参数 `current_expert_table`（形状为 `[num_layers, num_ranks, num_experts_per_rank]`）和 `expert_workload` 不变，并返回与内置策略相同的 `(changed_flag, per_layer_priority, new_expert_table)` 元组，其中 `per_layer_priority` 按计算出的放置方案对各层的改变程度对层进行排序。\n"
"例如："

msgid ""
"2. To add a new EPLB algorithm, include the policy type and its "
"corresponding implementation class in the `PolicyFactory` of "
"`policy_factory.py`. The policy type must be added to the allowed "
"`eplb_policy_type` values in `EplbConfig` (`vllm_ascend/ascend_config.py`) "
"as well."
msgstr ""
"2. 要添加新的 EPLB 算法，请在 `policy_factory.py` 的 `PolicyFactory` "
"中包含策略类型及其对应的实现类。同时必须将该策略类型添加到 "
"`EplbConfig`（`vllm_ascend/ascend_config.py`）中允许的 `eplb_policy_type` 取值里。"

msgid ""
"Note that the placement returned by a new policy must keep every logical "
"expert placed exactly once per layer (plus its redundant replicas on "
"distinct ranks); invalid placements are detected in `eplb_worker.py` and "
"rolled back to the previous table with an error log."
msgstr ""
"请注意，新策略返回的放置方案必须保证每个逻辑专家在每层恰好放置一次（外加其位于不同 rank 上的冗余副本）；无效的放置方案会在 "
"`eplb_worker.py` 中被检测到，并回滚到之前的表，同时记录错误日志。"

msgid ""
"1. **Adapter File Modification**\n"
"    - Extend `vllm_ascend/eplb/adaptor/vllm_adaptor.py`\n"
"    - The adaptor reads model-level facts from the model config (for example `first_k_dense_replace` for the dense-layer count); the global and local expert counts come from the registered MoE layers. Add model-specific parameters there when the config field names differ."
msgstr ""
"1. **修改适配器文件**\n"
"    - 扩展 `vllm_ascend/eplb/adaptor/vllm_adaptor.py`\n"
"    - 适配器从模型配置中读取模型级信息（例如用 `first_k_dense_replace` 表示稠密层数量）；全局和本地专家数量来自已注册的 MoE 层。当配置字段名称不同时，请在此处添加模型特定的参数。"

msgid ""
"2. **MoE Feature Integration**\n"
"    - Extend `vllm_ascend/ops/fused_moe/routed_experts.py` with MoE-specific expert-weight bookkeeping if the new model stores expert tensors differently"
msgstr ""
"2. **MoE 特性集成**\n"
"    - 如果新模型以不同方式存储专家张量，请扩展 `vllm_ascend/ops/fused_moe/routed_experts.py`，加入 MoE 特定的专家权重记录逻辑"

msgid ""
"3. **Registration Logic Update**\n"
"    - Ensure each MoE layer instance calls `VllmEplbAdaptor.register_layer` so the adaptor discovers the layer list for the current pipeline rank\n"
"    - Maintain backward compatibility with existing model types"
msgstr ""
"3. **更新注册逻辑**\n"
"    - 确保每个 MoE 层实例都调用 `VllmEplbAdaptor.register_layer`，以便适配器发现当前流水线 rank 的层列表\n"
"    - 保持与现有模型类型的向后兼容性"

msgid ""
"4. **Validation & Testing**\n"
"    - Verify parameter consistency across layers\n"
"    - Test cross-device communication for expert tables\n"
"    - Benchmark against baseline implementations (e.g., Qwen3-MoE)"
msgstr ""
"4. **验证与测试**\n"
"    - 验证各层之间参数的一致性\n"
"    - 测试专家表的跨设备通信\n"
"    - 与基线实现（例如 Qwen3-MoE）进行基准对比"

msgid ""
"- Preserve existing interface contracts in abstract classes\n"
"- Leverage `eplb_utils.py` for shared expert mapping operations"
msgstr ""
"- 保留抽象类中现有的接口约定\n"
"- 利用 `eplb_utils.py` 进行共享的专家映射操作"

msgid ""
"EPLB configuration is validated when the Ascend configuration is parsed\n"
"(`EplbConfig` in `vllm_ascend/ascend_config.py`):"
msgstr ""
"EPLB 配置在解析昇腾配置时进行校验\n"
"（`vllm_ascend/ascend_config.py` 中的 `EplbConfig`）："

msgid ""
"- Integer fields (`expert_heat_collection_interval`,\n"
"  `algorithm_execution_interval`, `num_redundant_experts`) must be integers;\n"
"  negative values are rejected.\n"
"- `eplb_policy_type` must be one of `0`, `1`, `2`, `3`.\n"
"- `eplb_heat_collection_stage` must be one of `all`, `prefill`, `decode`.\n"
"- Dynamic EPLB additionally requires the `DYNAMIC_EPLB` or\n"
"  `EXPERT_MAP_RECORD` environment variable as a safety guard.\n"
"- At placement time, `(num_experts + num_redundant_experts)` must be\n"
"  divisible by the expert-parallel size."
msgstr ""
"- 整数字段（`expert_heat_collection_interval`、\n"
"  `algorithm_execution_interval`、`num_redundant_experts`）必须为整数；\n"
"  负值将被拒绝。\n"
"- `eplb_policy_type` 必须为 `0`、`1`、`2`、`3` 之一。\n"
"- `eplb_heat_collection_stage` 必须为 `all`、`prefill`、`decode` 之一。\n"
"- 动态 EPLB 额外要求设置 `DYNAMIC_EPLB` 或\n"
"  `EXPERT_MAP_RECORD` 环境变量作为安全防护。\n"
"- 在放置时，`(num_experts + num_redundant_experts)` 必须\n"
"  能被专家并行度整除。"

msgid "### Observability"
msgstr "### 可观测性"

msgid ""
"- The balancing summary is logged on EP rank 0 once per cycle as\n"
"  `[eplb/worker] Expert hotness imbalance, current: mean=... max=..., updated: mean=... max=...`,\n"
"  where current/update are the mean and maximum per-layer peak-to-average\n"
"  load ratios before and after the computed placement.\n"
"- The same statistics are exported as `eplb:expert_hotness:*` gauges\n"
"  (`current_mean`, `current_max`, `update_mean`, `update_max`, and the\n"
"  per-layer `imbalance` series) when ms-service-metric collection is enabled.\n"
"- Subprocess failures stop further EPLB optimization for the process\n"
"  lifetime and are reported with `[eplb/worker]` warning logs."
msgstr ""
"- 每个周期在 EP rank 0 上记录一次均衡摘要，格式为\n"
"  `[eplb/worker] Expert hotness imbalance, current: mean=... max=..., updated: mean=... max=...`，\n"
"  其中 current/update 分别表示计算放置方案前后各层峰值与平均\n"
"  负载比值的均值和最大值。\n"
"- 当启用 ms-service-metric 采集时，相同的统计数据会以 `eplb:expert_hotness:*` gauge\n"
"  （`current_mean`、`current_max`、`update_mean`、`update_max` 以及\n"
"  各层的 `imbalance` 序列）形式导出。\n"
"- 子进程失败会在此进程生命周期内停止后续的 EPLB 优化，\n"
"  并通过 `[eplb/worker]` 警告日志进行报告。"

msgid ""
"Before using EPLB, start the script and add `export DYNAMIC_EPLB=\"true\"`.\n"
"Before performing load data collection (or performance data collection), start the script and add `export EXPERT_MAP_RECORD=\"true\"`.\n"
"MRv1 EPLB fields and MRv2 EPLB configuration are mutually exclusive; see the\n"
"[EPLB user guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md) for the validation rules."
msgstr ""
"使用 EPLB 之前，请启动脚本并添加 `export DYNAMIC_EPLB=\"true\"`。\n"
"在执行负载数据采集（或性能数据采集）之前，请启动脚本并添加 `export EXPERT_MAP_RECORD=\"true\"`。\n"
"MRv1 EPLB 字段与 MRv2 EPLB 配置互斥；校验规则请参阅\n"
"[EPLB 用户指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md)。"
